        "title": "Understanding the Factor Theorem",
        "text": "The Factor Theorem says: $(x - a)$ is a factor of polynomial $f(x)$ if and only if $f(a) = 0$.\n\nSince we're testing $(x - 2)$, we need $a = 2$.",
